WEBVTT

00:16:59.748 --> 00:17:01.756
Your memories and associations and so on.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.419
Most people would say
for a lot, a lot of money.

00:17:04.443 --> 00:17:05.607
(Laughter)

00:17:05.631 --> 00:17:07.015
On good days.

00:17:07.039 --> 00:17:08.279
(Laughter)

00:17:08.303 --> 00:17:10.208
But imagine this was slightly different.

00:17:10.232 --> 00:17:12.042
Imagine if you did not have your kids.

00:17:12.066 --> 00:17:14.801
And one day you went to the park
and you met some kids.

00:17:14.825 --> 00:17:16.307
They were just like your kids,

00:17:16.331 --> 00:17:18.349
and you played with them for a few hours,

00:17:18.373 --> 00:17:21.722
and when you were about to leave,
the parents said, "Hey, by the way,

00:17:21.746 --> 00:17:24.729
just before you leave,
if you're interested, they're for sale."

00:17:24.753 --> 00:17:26.859
(Laughter)

00:17:26.883 --> 00:17:29.113
How much would you pay for them now?

00:17:29.803 --> 00:17:31.900
Most people say not that much.